project: "Waffle Stitch example"
gauge: 4 in = 26 sts, 52 rows

note: "This program demonstrates the ability to depict different types of stitches using group repeats"

cast_on 43 sts
for 9 in:
    1 row: k1, p to last 1, k1.
    2 row: k to end.
    3 row: (k1, sl1p) to last 1, k1.
    4 row: (k1, sl1k) to last 1, k1.
    note: "end on row 3"
end

note: "follow this sequence as you bind off"
row: k1, (k1,p1) to last 2, k2.

bind_off